### ============================================
### TEST PHÂN QUYỀN - HR PAYROLL SYSTEM
### ============================================
### 
### PHÂN QUYỀN RÕ RÀNG:
### 
### SUPER_ADMIN (admin):
###   ✅ Tất cả trang
###   ✅ Tạo user + phân quyền
###   ✅ Xem access logs
### 
### HR_MANAGER (hr_manager):
###   ✅ Employees, Departments, Reports
###   ❌ Users (KHÔNG tạo user)
###   ❌ Access Logs
###   ❌ Salaries
### 
### PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT (accountant):
###   ✅ Salaries, Reports
###   ❌ Users, Access Logs, Employees, Departments
### 
### EMPLOYEE (employee):
###   ✅ Dashboard, Profile (chỉ của mình)
###   ❌ Tất cả trang quản lý
### 
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### ============================================
### BƯỚC 1: ĐĂNG NHẬP
### ============================================

### 1.1. Login as SUPER_ADMIN
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 1.2. Login as HR_MANAGER
# @name hrLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "hr_manager",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 1.3. Login as PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT
# @name accountantLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "accountant",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 1.4. Login as EMPLOYEE
# @name employeeLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "employee",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### ============================================
### BƯỚC 2: PASTE TOKEN VÀO ĐÂY
### ============================================

@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@hrToken = PASTE_HR_TOKEN_HERE
@accountantToken = PASTE_ACCOUNTANT_TOKEN_HERE
@employeeToken = PASTE_EMPLOYEE_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================
### TEST 1: USER MANAGEMENT (Tạo User + Phân Quyền)
### ============================================

### ✅ 1.1. SUPER_ADMIN - Get users with roles (Should SUCCESS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###

### ✅ 1.2. SUPER_ADMIN - Create user with roles (Should SUCCESS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "testuser@company.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "roleIds": [2, 4]
}

###

### ❌ 1.3. HR_MANAGER - Get users (Should FAIL - 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

###

### ❌ 1.4. HR_MANAGER - Create user (Should FAIL - 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{hrToken}}

{
  "username": "testuser2",
  "email": "testuser2@company.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "roleIds": [4]
}

###

### ❌ 1.5. PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT - Get users (Should FAIL - 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accountantToken}}

###

### ❌ 1.6. EMPLOYEE - Get users (Should FAIL - 403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users-with-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}

###

