### ============================================
### EXPECTED RESULTS - KẾT QUẢ MONG ĐỢI
### ============================================

# TEST 1: USER MANAGEMENT
# 1.1. SUPER_ADMIN → 200 OK (có data users với roles)
# 1.2. SUPER_ADMIN → 201 Created (user created)
# 1.3. HR_MANAGER → 403 Forbidden (không được tạo user)
# 1.4. HR_MANAGER → 403 Forbidden (không được tạo user)
# 1.5. PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT → 403 Forbidden
# 1.6. EMPLOYEE → 403 Forbidden

# TEST 2: ACCESS LOGS
# 2.1. SUPER_ADMIN → 200 OK (có data logs)
# 2.2. HR_MANAGER → 403 Forbidden
# 2.3. PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT → 403 Forbidden
# 2.4. EMPLOYEE → 403 Forbidden

# TEST 3: EMPLOYEE MANAGEMENT
# 3.1. SUPER_ADMIN → 200 OK
# 3.2. HR_MANAGER → 200 OK
# 3.3. PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT → 403 Forbidden
# 3.4. EMPLOYEE → 403 Forbidden

# TEST 4: DEPARTMENT MANAGEMENT
# 4.1. SUPER_ADMIN → 200 OK
# 4.2. HR_MANAGER → 200 OK
# 4.3. PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT → 403 Forbidden
# 4.4. EMPLOYEE → 403 Forbidden

# TEST 5: SALARY MANAGEMENT
# 5.1. SUPER_ADMIN → 200 OK
# 5.2. PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT → 200 OK
# 5.3. HR_MANAGER → 403 Forbidden
# 5.4. EMPLOYEE → 403 Forbidden

# TEST 6: REPORTS
# 6.1. SUPER_ADMIN → 200 OK
# 6.2. HR_MANAGER → 200 OK
# 6.3. PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT → 200 OK
# 6.4. EMPLOYEE → 403 Forbidden

# TEST 7: PROFILE
# 7.1-7.4. All → 200 OK (tất cả đều xem được profile của mình)

# TEST 8: NO TOKEN
# 8.1-8.2. All → 401 Unauthorized

# TEST 9: INVALID TOKEN
# 9.1. → 401 Unauthorized

### ============================================
### SUMMARY - TÓM TẮT
### ============================================

# ✅ SUPER_ADMIN:
#    - Tất cả endpoints → 200 OK
#    - Tạo user + phân quyền → 201 Created
#    - Xem access logs → 200 OK

# ✅ HR_MANAGER:
#    - Employees, Departments, Reports, Profile → 200 OK
#    - Users, Access Logs, Salaries → 403 Forbidden

# ✅ PAYROLL_ACCOUNTANT:
#    - Salaries, Reports, Profile → 200 OK
#    - Users, Access Logs, Employees, Departments → 403 Forbidden

